\includegraphics[width=\textwidth]{figures/paper/fig_hero_overview.pdf}
\caption{Overview of VLA token compressibility.
\textbf{(a)}~The same robot observation produces qualitatively different token importance patterns through different vision connectors, quantified by the coefficient of variation (CV) of post-connector token norms.
\textbf{(b)}~Two axes govern pruning robustness: token coupling (independent vs.\ entangling connectors) and task complexity (single-step vs.\ multi-step).
\textbf{(c)}~A single forward pass CV diagnostic routes each architecture to an appropriate compression strategy: uniform pruning, importance-based scoring, or learned re-encoding.}
\label{fig:teaser}
